        -- The log scope CLOUDWATCH_TELEMETRY_RULE_MANAGED indicates a configuration that is managed through Amazon CloudWatch Logs for telemetry data collection and analysis. For information, see
        -- What is Amazon CloudWatch Logs ?
        -- in the Amazon CloudWatch Logs user guide.
